WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.480
Retro Console lets you play classic console games together, even when you're far apart.

2
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:17.339
The host picks a game. There are free homebrew games built in, or you can load a game file you already own from your own computer. It never gets uploaded anywhere.

3
00:00:17.489 --> 00:00:22.769
The host's browser runs the console and streams the picture and sound to everyone.

4
00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:37.979
The first two players get controllers one and two, and everybody else watches. On a keyboard, the arrows are the directional pad, and X and Z are the buttons. On a phone, there's an on-screen pad, and gamepads work too.

5
00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:43.462
Expect a tiny bit of lag for the guests, and the host needs to keep their tab open.
